(408534, 35458, 7343, '<td valign="top">This seems a little jumbled or cluttered.  I think I would have liked a different perspective a little better, with more a view of either staring looky-loos or the actual scene.</td>', 'This seems a little jumbled or cluttered.  I think I would have liked a different perspective a little better, with more a view of either staring looky-loos or the actual scene.', '2003-09-03 15:14:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(408536, 35806, 2091, '<td valign="top">I''m ipressed with this, I''m amazed you caught the spark that well :)</td>', 'I''m ipressed with this, I''m amazed you caught the spark that well :)', '2003-09-03 15:15:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(408541, 36061, 7343, '<td valign="top">Pretty colors and silhouette of the rose.  Ida mebbe made the subject a bit more obvious (can''t see the basket) and centered the sun a little more.</td>', 'Pretty colors and silhouette of the rose.  Ida mebbe made the subject a bit more obvious (can''t see the basket) and centered the sun a little more.', '2003-09-03 15:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(408543, 36160, 7343, '<td valign="top">One of the first ones Ive seen in the challenge that really looks like an "Oooops!", rather than a broken egg or something.  I like the detail on the pen but wish the light was a little less glaring on it.</td>', 'One of the first ones Ive seen in the challenge that really looks like an "Oooops!", rather than a broken egg or something.  I like the detail on the pen but wish the light was a little less glaring on it.', '2003-09-03 15:18:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(408544, 36007, 6405, '<td valign="top">Not enough Ketchup here,great idea  9 from me!</td>', 'Not enough Ketchup here,great idea  9 from me!', '2003-09-03 15:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(408546, 35847, 7343, '<td valign="top">I find myself counting how people are able to capture the oops factor in their pictures more, because very view actually have taken a good picture of a real oops.  This is a real oops (well, for some it would be).  I like the emphasis on the blue.  Maybe would have used a little more light to capture what i think is the top to the test thingy (the black doodah on the right).</td>', 'I find myself counting how people are able to capture the oops factor in their pictures more, because very view actually have taken a good picture of a real oops.  This is a real oops (well, for some it would be).  I like the emphasis on the blue.  Maybe would have used a little more light to capture what i think is the top to the test thingy (the black doodah on the right).', '2003-09-03 15:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(408548, 36256, 7343, '<td valign="top">One of the more creative oops I''ve seen here.  This is pretty nitpicky but i would have maybe moved the 1010101''s that are right over eachother (two lines above the 2) so they were off center from eachother a little more.  but that''s pretty nitpicky.</td>', 'One of the more creative oops I''ve seen here.  This is pretty nitpicky but i would have maybe moved the 1010101''s that are right over eachother (two lines above the 2) so they were off center from eachother a little more.  but that''s pretty nitpicky.', '2003-09-03 15:23:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(408549, 35752, 7343, '<td valign="top">This seems a little dark.  The fact that it''s in the grass throws me a little bit, because it''s real hard to nail anything on the grass.  A different setting (work bench or something) would have added a lot i think.</td>', 'This seems a little dark.  The fact that it''s in the grass throws me a little bit, because it''s real hard to nail anything on the grass.  A different setting (work bench or something) would have added a lot i think.', '2003-09-03 15:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(408550, 35499, 7343, '<td valign="top">Good oops.  Could have used a flash or little more lighting me thinks though.</td>', 'Good oops.  Could have used a flash or little more lighting me thinks though.', '2003-09-03 15:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
