(409120, 35298, 10799, '<td valign="top">I think the composition is good.  The depth of field might be a bit too short.  The grass and bricks seem to be off color and not detailed enough.  You did a good job getting the fire.</td>', 'I think the composition is good.  The depth of field might be a bit too short.  The grass and bricks seem to be off color and not detailed enough.  You did a good job getting the fire.', '2003-09-03 22:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(409121, 35811, 7969, '<td valign="top">You certainly get a point for being in the right place at the right time.  Wish the image were larger.   Good job.</td>', 'You certainly get a point for being in the right place at the right time.  Wish the image were larger.   Good job.', '2003-09-03 22:39:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(409122, 36146, 9643, '<td valign="top">Suggestion:  The lights on the top of the car should be on and the expression of the "arrested" could be a little more serious.  Excellent clarity and framing holds my attention.</td>', 'Suggestion:  The lights on the top of the car should be on and the expression of the "arrested" could be a little more serious.  Excellent clarity and framing holds my attention.', '2003-09-03 22:40:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(409124, 36088, 10799, '<td valign="top">The title is very confusing to me.  I see birds eating.... and one in mid air.... <br/>Despite my confusion...I think it should be cropped to get rid of the pipe and the wall above the pipe.  The bricks are very detailed and the color is great.</td>', 'The title is very confusing to me.  I see birds eating.... and one in mid air.... Despite my confusion...I think it should be cropped to get rid of the pipe and the wall above the pipe.  The bricks are very detailed and the color is great.', '2003-09-03 22:41:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(409131, 36230, 10799, '<td valign="top">No, I think this is actually correct... all of this does add up to spagetti!  Very creative and well done. I might have either moved the glass a bit into the picture or all the way out of it.</td>', 'No, I think this is actually correct... all of this does add up to spagetti!  Very creative and well done. I might have either moved the glass a bit into the picture or all the way out of it.', '2003-09-03 22:52:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(409132, 35607, 9643, '<td valign="top">Points for bravery with this shot.</td>', 'Points for bravery with this shot.', '2003-09-03 22:52:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(409133, 36101, 10799, '<td valign="top">a bit dark ....on the bottom right.</td>', 'a bit dark ....on the bottom right.', '2003-09-03 22:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(409136, 35727, 9643, '<td valign="top">This is a very serious interpretation of the challenge and I feel that your photo speaks volumes about "something gone wrong" for so many people.  This piece deserves some recognition and I hope that you get it.</td>', 'This is a very serious interpretation of the challenge and I feel that your photo speaks volumes about "something gone wrong" for so many people.  This piece deserves some recognition and I hope that you get it.', '2003-09-03 22:57:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(409138, 36084, 10799, '<td valign="top">Well done.  I like the black and white treatment.</td>', 'Well done.  I like the black and white treatment.', '2003-09-03 22:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(409143, 35979, 10799, '<td valign="top">The tree in the background seems to be growing out of his shoulders... a differnt angle might have helped.</td>', 'The tree in the background seems to be growing out of his shoulders... a differnt angle might have helped.', '2003-09-03 23:02:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(409145, 36236, 9907, '<td valign="top">too blurry</td>', 'too blurry', '2003-09-03 23:05:50.000000', NULL, 1),
