(409150, 36195, 9643, '<td valign="top">I was going to try something similar - missing the ball off the tee, but haven''t the expertise yet to capture, as you did, the ball and clubhead in mid air.  I really like the proportion of clubhead and ball to the background.  My only criticism or question is why choose for the top 2/3 of the background to be bland?</td>', 'I was going to try something similar - missing the ball off the tee, but haven''t the expertise yet to capture, as you did, the ball and clubhead in mid air.  I really like the proportion of clubhead and ball to the background.  My only criticism or question is why choose for the top 2/3 of the background to be bland?', '2003-09-03 23:08:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(409152, 35870, 10833, '<td valign="top">Cute picture, I have the urge to score egg breakage lower, but this one is original :)  Good lighting and sinple background</td>', 'Cute picture, I have the urge to score egg breakage lower, but this one is original :)  Good lighting and sinple background', '2003-09-03 23:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(409153, 36062, 10833, '<td valign="top">I would have rated higher if not so much glare</td>', 'I would have rated higher if not so much glare', '2003-09-03 23:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(409154, 35738, 9907, '<td valign="top">and the............is</td>', 'and the............is', '2003-09-03 23:10:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(409155, 35620, 10833, '<td valign="top">I like the motion capture on the front foot.</td>', 'I like the motion capture on the front foot.', '2003-09-03 23:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(409156, 35727, 10833, '<td valign="top">Overall a great picture, but I''m not sure it fits the challenge.</td>', 'Overall a great picture, but I''m not sure it fits the challenge.', '2003-09-03 23:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(409159, 35952, 10833, '<td valign="top">I might have cropped the left part of the picture a bit tighter, but I like it.  Good lighting, composition and original.</td>', 'I might have cropped the left part of the picture a bit tighter, but I like it.  Good lighting, composition and original.', '2003-09-03 23:17:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(409161, 36215, 10833, '<td valign="top">This is a cute idea with great execution.</td>', 'This is a cute idea with great execution.', '2003-09-03 23:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(409174, 35791, 9073, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. Visually lacking. Too many elements for the eye to be drawn to the point only.</td>', 'Nice idea. Visually lacking. Too many elements for the eye to be drawn to the point only.', '2003-09-03 23:34:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(409176, 36065, 11748, '<td valign="top">Nice overall composition and lighting.</td>', 'Nice overall composition and lighting.', '2003-09-03 23:37:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(409177, 35310, 9073, '<td valign="top">The blue cast is too strong.</td>', 'The blue cast is too strong.', '2003-09-03 23:37:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(409180, 36041, 8125, '<td valign="top">Good idea!  Well thought out and implemented!  I like the use of black and white.</td>', 'Good idea!  Well thought out and implemented!  I like the use of black and white.', '2003-09-03 23:38:44.000000', NULL, 1),
