(409233, 35727, 8125, '<td valign="top">Good picture - well taken, I like the use of black and white.  I just don''t understand the oops....</td>', 'Good picture - well taken, I like the use of black and white.  I just don''t understand the oops....', '2003-09-04 00:14:08.000000', NULL, 1),
