(409247, 36039, 8125, '<td valign="top">Definately an oops... nice action shot.  Not sure how it relates to a ''cookout disaster''.  Might have more impact if there was less on top and you showed the grill or someone sitting below it??</td>', 'Definately an oops... nice action shot.  Not sure how it relates to a ''cookout disaster''.  Might have more impact if there was less on top and you showed the grill or someone sitting below it??', '2003-09-04 00:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(409250, 36062, 8125, '<td valign="top">This one is a bit out of focus and the lighting makes it hard to see the Sprite can.  Nice catch on the action shot.</td>', 'This one is a bit out of focus and the lighting makes it hard to see the Sprite can.  Nice catch on the action shot.', '2003-09-04 00:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(409251, 35856, 8125, '<td valign="top">That''s my question.. I''m not sure what''s wrong here.  The white of the dog''s fur with the b&amp;w exposure makes the image hard to decipher.</td>', 'That''s my question.. I''m not sure what''s wrong here.  The white of the dog''s fur with the b&w exposure makes the image hard to decipher.', '2003-09-04 00:27:30.000000', NULL, 1),
