(410217, 36193, 9643, '<td valign="top">I liked this image very much from the beginning and have moved it up three times in rating since completing my votes and studying the thumbnails.  It is such a simple idea but I suspect not quite so simple to achieve.  The coloring and texture of this shot makes it outstandingly real to me.   10</td>', 'I liked this image very much from the beginning and have moved it up three times in rating since completing my votes and studying the thumbnails.  It is such a simple idea but I suspect not quite so simple to achieve.  The coloring and texture of this shot makes it outstandingly real to me.   10', '2003-09-04 22:40:37.000000', NULL, 1),
