(410488, 36187, 9295, '<td valign="top">Great theme for the challenge but the photo itself isn''t very eye-catching. I don''t know what to suggest to make it better, maybe lighting or a different pose from your model, but for an Oops, this one fits the bill.</td>', 'Great theme for the challenge but the photo itself isn''t very eye-catching. I don''t know what to suggest to make it better, maybe lighting or a different pose from your model, but for an Oops, this one fits the bill.', '2003-09-05 10:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(410491, 36041, 9295, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite of the challenge.  I love everything about it from the humor of the theme to those excellent expressions on your models'' faces.  The lighting is nice as it comes in from the left like the light from a bedside table and I like that you used black and white.  Just great. Good luck!</td>', 'This is my favorite of the challenge.  I love everything about it from the humor of the theme to those excellent expressions on your models'' faces.  The lighting is nice as it comes in from the left like the light from a bedside table and I like that you used black and white.  Just great. Good luck!', '2003-09-05 10:46:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(410494, 36222, 10768, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp image.  Original idea.  10</td>', 'Nice sharp image.  Original idea.  10', '2003-09-05 10:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(410496, 36239, 9295, '<td valign="top">I mostly like this photo, but I think the colors aren''t doing much for me. I love the capture of the water and the fact that the cup is on an angle so you can get a sense of the impact. I also like the texture of the backdrop surface compared with the textures created by the water in the cup.  I wonder if it might not have worked a little better using a different color or clear cup, or perhaps using black and white. All in all, I like it though.  Definitely an Oops most of us can relate to.</td>', 'I mostly like this photo, but I think the colors aren''t doing much for me. I love the capture of the water and the fact that the cup is on an angle so you can get a sense of the impact. I also like the texture of the backdrop surface compared with the textures created by the water in the cup.  I wonder if it might not have worked a little better using a different color or clear cup, or perhaps using black and white. All in all, I like it though.  Definitely an Oops most of us can relate to.', '2003-09-05 10:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(410513, 35972, 10077, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but I woul''ve got rid of the car in the back, that only disctracts, and the focus could be better on the dart that missed.  Is this a sepia intended picture ?</td>', 'I like the idea, but I woul''ve got rid of the car in the back, that only disctracts, and the focus could be better on the dart that missed.  Is this a sepia intended picture ?', '2003-09-05 11:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(410517, 36222, 10077, '<td valign="top">My favorite so far...  I''m sure you tried several takes before this one.  I only wonder how this picture could look like with the mouse smelling the cheese, instead of the grapes.  Also, I''m not sure if it''s my monitor... but the scene seems a little bit rotated to the left (If you take a close look at the bottle of wine).  Very good composition and color. I say 10.</td>', 'My favorite so far...  I''m sure you tried several takes before this one.  I only wonder how this picture could look like with the mouse smelling the cheese, instead of the grapes.  Also, I''m not sure if it''s my monitor... but the scene seems a little bit rotated to the left (If you take a close look at the bottle of wine).  Very good composition and color. I say 10.', '2003-09-05 11:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
