(411346, 35643, 11073, '<td valign="top">something tells me that the "flower" photographers on this site won''t appreciate this shot...but I love taking shots from the car, I put em on my website all the time, so I appreciate this shot.  The reflection is good, and the composition is there.  Its not as sharp as it could be, but then maybe you were moving. The sky is a little blown out, but just drop the exposure a point or two and your there. Good idea and cool shot.  The play on the category (the title) is a good idea too.</td>', 'something tells me that the "flower" photographers on this site won''t appreciate this shot...but I love taking shots from the car, I put em on my website all the time, so I appreciate this shot.  The reflection is good, and the composition is there.  Its not as sharp as it could be, but then maybe you were moving. The sky is a little blown out, but just drop the exposure a point or two and your there. Good idea and cool shot.  The play on the category (the title) is a good idea too.', '2003-09-07 00:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(411349, 36262, 11073, '<td valign="top">good idea - try a different surface to bring out the "egg juice" next time - something darker perhaps.  Zoom in a little to bring the subject more into the frame and your there.  Also try a bright light instead of the flash for the subject - it will highlight the entire subject and not just the parts of the liquid that reflect the flash.  Good idea and nice effort. 6.</td>', 'good idea - try a different surface to bring out the "egg juice" next time - something darker perhaps.  Zoom in a little to bring the subject more into the frame and your there.  Also try a bright light instead of the flash for the subject - it will highlight the entire subject and not just the parts of the liquid that reflect the flash.  Good idea and nice effort. 6.', '2003-09-07 00:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(411351, 36237, 11073, '<td valign="top">good idea and execution</td>', 'good idea and execution', '2003-09-07 00:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
