(411409, 36007, 11943, '<td valign="top">Urgh!What a gross photograph!But it brings across the idea of "oops" much better than some of the others. It''s also very cleverly set up (I''m assuming you didn''t really chop off your finger) and it''s a good compositionl</td>', 'Urgh!What a gross photograph!But it brings across the idea of "oops" much better than some of the others. It''s also very cleverly set up (I''m assuming you didn''t really chop off your finger) and it''s a good compositionl', '2003-09-07 08:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(411410, 35643, 11943, '<td valign="top">This shot is very photojournalismy...just finding something in the street, thinking it looks interesting and taking a picture. But, though you''re heading in the right direction, you said it yourself. You should have stopped and planned it out a bit more. But it''s a good attempt and it does sum up "oops" very well!</td>', 'This shot is very photojournalismy...just finding something in the street, thinking it looks interesting and taking a picture. But, though you''re heading in the right direction, you said it yourself. You should have stopped and planned it out a bit more. But it''s a good attempt and it does sum up "oops" very well!', '2003-09-07 08:20:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(411411, 36193, 11943, '<td valign="top">Though this picture does not really sum up oop (but the title does!) I still think it is good. It''s a very clever and different idea. I think it''s a really well captured close up ( all my close ups are blurry).</td>', 'Though this picture does not really sum up oop (but the title does!) I still think it is good. It''s a very clever and different idea. I think it''s a really well captured close up ( all my close ups are blurry).', '2003-09-07 08:22:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(411412, 35506, 11943, '<td valign="top">This is a very clever idea.I like the detail in this shot...the welly boots, the seat. I like the angles of the buildings leading your eye through the whole picture as well. This would be a good commercial shot for a greetings card (for example).Very good!</td>', 'This is a very clever idea.I like the detail in this shot...the welly boots, the seat. I like the angles of the buildings leading your eye through the whole picture as well. This would be a good commercial shot for a greetings card (for example).Very good!', '2003-09-07 08:24:21.000000', NULL, 1),
