(412719, 35506, 8860, '<td valign="top">My favourite! Great stuff and an excellent shot to go with some surreal humour. One of only two [10]s</td>', 'My favourite! Great stuff and an excellent shot to go with some surreal humour. One of only two [10]s', '2003-09-08 17:06:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(412720, 36146, 5982, '<td valign="top">the smile on the face destroys the credibility of this picture, doesn''t it?</td>', 'the smile on the face destroys the credibility of this picture, doesn''t it?', '2003-09-08 17:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(412725, 35606, 8860, '<td valign="top">Sweeeet! :D  [9]</td>', 'Sweeeet! :D  [9]', '2003-09-08 17:14:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(412730, 36170, 8860, '<td valign="top">Good snap, but you could have cropped the right side heavily to focus more on the cone.</td>', 'Good snap, but you could have cropped the right side heavily to focus more on the cone.', '2003-09-08 17:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(412733, 36233, 8860, '<td valign="top">Not for long though! ;)  Good composition and I like the concept.</td>', 'Not for long though! ;)  Good composition and I like the concept.', '2003-09-08 17:17:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(412798, 36149, 9523, '<td valign="top">Blood isn''t as thick as ketchup. The green, red and white go nicely together, though.</td>', 'Blood isn''t as thick as ketchup. The green, red and white go nicely together, though.', '2003-09-08 18:14:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(412800, 36039, 9523, '<td valign="top">Disaster? If that were the last bottle of water on Earth, maybe.</td>', 'Disaster? If that were the last bottle of water on Earth, maybe.', '2003-09-08 18:15:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(412801, 35323, 9523, '<td valign="top">Awesome. Pity you weren''t closer.</td>', 'Awesome. Pity you weren''t closer.', '2003-09-08 18:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(412803, 35727, 9523, '<td valign="top">First, he doesn''t look poor. Second, treating poverty as a mere "oops" is disgraceful.</td>', 'First, he doesn''t look poor. Second, treating poverty as a mere "oops" is disgraceful.', '2003-09-08 18:17:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(412807, 36028, 9523, '<td valign="top">"Hey, honey, let''s waste time taking a picture of an injured bird instead of taking it to a vet." Nice shot, though.</td>', '"Hey, honey, let''s waste time taking a picture of an injured bird instead of taking it to a vet." Nice shot, though.', '2003-09-08 18:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(412808, 35895, 9523, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and contrast.</td>', 'Nice lighting and contrast.', '2003-09-08 18:20:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(412858, 35791, 11073, '<td valign="top">good effect :)  wish the background was a more contrasting color...good composition.</td>', 'good effect :)  wish the background was a more contrasting color...good composition.', '2003-09-08 18:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(412870, 35925, 11034, '<td valign="top">Its a very very nice photo but I dont see the ooops factor.</td>', 'Its a very very nice photo but I dont see the ooops factor.', '2003-09-08 18:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(412872, 36042, 11034, '<td valign="top">Sorry but i miss the ooops factor</td>', 'Sorry but i miss the ooops factor', '2003-09-08 18:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(412873, 35400, 11034, '<td valign="top">If you take it vertical you will get a better place. Nice concept and shoot.</td>', 'If you take it vertical you will get a better place. Nice concept and shoot.', '2003-09-08 18:59:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(412899, 36079, 11938, '<td valign="top">nice photo. but I don''t think it belongs in this theme</td>', 'nice photo. but I don''t think it belongs in this theme', '2003-09-08 19:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(412918, 36158, 8860, '<td valign="top">I''m sure he''ll perk up with a bit of Trill! ;)  Or at least I hope this is a joke?</td>', 'I''m sure he''ll perk up with a bit of Trill! ;)  Or at least I hope this is a joke?', '2003-09-08 19:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(412939, 36007, 10263, '<td valign="top">ewwwwwww. This is funny though :) clever set up.</td>', 'ewwwwwww. This is funny though :) clever set up.', '2003-09-08 19:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(412942, 35856, 10263, '<td valign="top">I don''t see the oops here? Cute dog :)</td>', 'I don''t see the oops here? Cute dog :)', '2003-09-08 19:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(413025, 36153, 12017, '<td valign="top">it would be nice to see a slow shutter speed with movement in the hammer</td>', 'it would be nice to see a slow shutter speed with movement in the hammer', '2003-09-08 21:41:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(413077, 35896, 11748, '<td valign="top">Good composition and concept. I like the execution as well. Great job!</td>', 'Good composition and concept. I like the execution as well. Great job!', '2003-09-08 22:23:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(413088, 35770, 11034, '<td valign="top">The only but... is too centered, but still a very very good shoot. One of my fav.</td>', 'The only but... is too centered, but still a very very good shoot. One of my fav.', '2003-09-08 22:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(413090, 35513, 11034, '<td valign="top">Avery nice abstract, but i don see the ooops factor. In other challenge could do better<br/></td>', 'Avery nice abstract, but i don see the ooops factor. In other challenge could do better', '2003-09-08 22:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(413091, 35738, 11034, '<td valign="top">Wheres the ooops facor here? Actually see like a very peaceful place to be. Nice picture.</td>', 'Wheres the ooops facor here? Actually see like a very peaceful place to be. Nice picture.', '2003-09-08 22:42:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(413093, 36060, 11034, '<td valign="top">I really like the face of men. It meaning Ooops!. The only but... is your shadow left. 8</td>', 'I really like the face of men. It meaning Ooops!. The only but... is your shadow left. 8', '2003-09-08 22:44:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(413201, 36079, 7151, '<td valign="top">Staircase - and out of focus at that.  Don\''t get what\''s the oops here.</td>', 'Staircase - and out of focus at that.  Don\''t get what\''s the oops here.', '2003-09-09 02:38:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(413203, 35952, 7151, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I don''t get it.  Maybe it''s a language thing...?</td>', 'Sorry, I don''t get it.  Maybe it''s a language thing...?', '2003-09-09 02:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(413204, 36147, 7151, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit forced.  The photo''s a bit noisy.</td>', 'Seems a bit forced.  The photo''s a bit noisy.', '2003-09-09 02:42:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(413205, 35752, 7151, '<td valign="top">Odd location - why hammer in the grass?  The photo''s a bit too centered.  Cutting off the bottom grass and adding more of the claw-end of the hammer might have worked better compositionally.  It''s pretty obvious that no thumbs were harmed in the making of this photo - which gives it a kind of a stiff feel.  Focal point is well done.  Basically an OK shot that meets the challenge, but doesn''t really stand out.</td>', 'Odd location - why hammer in the grass?  The photo''s a bit too centered.  Cutting off the bottom grass and adding more of the claw-end of the hammer might have worked better compositionally.  It''s pretty obvious that no thumbs were harmed in the making of this photo - which gives it a kind of a stiff feel.  Focal point is well done.  Basically an OK shot that meets the challenge, but doesn''t really stand out.', '2003-09-09 02:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(413206, 36092, 7151, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I don''t get it.  As a photo, it''s pretty blown out, the lightings pretty harsh, focus isn''t too sharp.</td>', 'Sorry, I don''t get it.  As a photo, it''s pretty blown out, the lightings pretty harsh, focus isn''t too sharp.', '2003-09-09 02:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(413207, 35639, 7151, '<td valign="top">Given the roller coaster in the background, I have to assume this is a prop at an amusement part, and therefore not much of an oops.  Nice color though.</td>', 'Given the roller coaster in the background, I have to assume this is a prop at an amusement part, and therefore not much of an oops.  Nice color though.', '2003-09-09 02:49:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(413209, 36039, 7151, '<td valign="top">What''s the disaster?  Spilt water?  It''s a bit noisy, and the compositions kind of stiff.</td>', 'What''s the disaster?  Spilt water?  It''s a bit noisy, and the compositions kind of stiff.', '2003-09-09 02:51:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(413211, 35862, 7151, '<td valign="top">Cute.  The composition''s a bit rigid, though I don''t have any specific ideas on how to do it better, just maybe a little more angled.  Lighting''s just on the edge of too bright, but OK.  Focus is great.</td>', 'Cute.  The composition''s a bit rigid, though I don''t have any specific ideas on how to do it better, just maybe a little more angled.  Lighting''s just on the edge of too bright, but OK.  Focus is great.', '2003-09-09 02:53:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(413212, 35972, 7151, '<td valign="top">Missed the focus too.  ;-)  But I''m sure you''ve gotten lots of that already.  Could have been a good idea, but the photo''s just too fuzzy.  Also, the angle and position could have been done better, maybe getting the numbers more horizontal, and definitely getting the car out of the background.</td>', 'Missed the focus too.  ;-)  But I''m sure you''ve gotten lots of that already.  Could have been a good idea, but the photo''s just too fuzzy.  Also, the angle and position could have been done better, maybe getting the numbers more horizontal, and definitely getting the car out of the background.', '2003-09-09 02:56:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(413213, 36033, 7151, '<td valign="top">Did they pistol-whip you for taking this shot?  ;-)  An OK idea, but looks pretty much like a snapshot.  Just an average shot.</td>', 'Did they pistol-whip you for taking this shot?  ;-)  An OK idea, but looks pretty much like a snapshot.  Just an average shot.', '2003-09-09 02:58:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(413214, 35323, 7151, '<td valign="top">You should have gotten closer.  And it looks like you fired the flash, which just lit up the fence, which just distracts from the blaze.  Closer and no flash would have worked better.</td>', 'You should have gotten closer.  And it looks like you fired the flash, which just lit up the fence, which just distracts from the blaze.  Closer and no flash would have worked better.', '2003-09-09 03:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(413215, 35527, 7151, '<td valign="top">Would have been more interesting with a ball in the frame.</td>', 'Would have been more interesting with a ball in the frame.', '2003-09-09 03:01:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(413216, 36007, 7151, '<td valign="top">The different skin tones kind of kill the effect, not to mention the ketchup-for-blood.  If your interested let me know - I''ll send you a shot of my similar real-life oops.  Someone suggested it after the challenge was over.  :-(</td>', 'The different skin tones kind of kill the effect, not to mention the ketchup-for-blood.  If your interested let me know - I''ll send you a shot of my similar real-life oops.  Someone suggested it after the challenge was over.  :-(', '2003-09-09 03:05:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(413217, 35795, 7151, '<td valign="top">On the edge of what?  Going down a pretty small ramp?  Doesn''t really show any "oops".</td>', 'On the edge of what?  Going down a pretty small ramp?  Doesn''t really show any "oops".', '2003-09-09 03:06:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(413218, 36051, 12028, '<td valign="top">What a fantastic photo! Did you toss the guy in there yourself? love the grain and the many meanings of oops expressed in the photo.</td>', 'What a fantastic photo! Did you toss the guy in there yourself? love the grain and the many meanings of oops expressed in the photo.', '2003-09-09 03:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(413219, 35727, 7151, '<td valign="top">Language barrier, I assume.  Oops generally implies a silly mistake.  Poverty doesn''t really fit.  It is a pretty nice photo, so I''m tempted to give the benefit of the doubt... but then, this guy doesn''t look too poverty-striken.  He looks very well-nourished, clean, and has a nice pair of jeans (with colored underwear peaking out at that).</td>', 'Language barrier, I assume.  Oops generally implies a silly mistake.  Poverty doesn''t really fit.  It is a pretty nice photo, so I''m tempted to give the benefit of the doubt... but then, this guy doesn''t look too poverty-striken.  He looks very well-nourished, clean, and has a nice pair of jeans (with colored underwear peaking out at that).', '2003-09-09 03:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(413220, 35848, 7151, '<td valign="top">What''s wrong???</td>', 'What''s wrong???', '2003-09-09 03:11:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(413221, 36170, 7151, '<td valign="top">Wow!  How much did that cone cost?  The shot is a bit crooked and noisy, but a funny shot.</td>', 'Wow!  How much did that cone cost?  The shot is a bit crooked and noisy, but a funny shot.', '2003-09-09 03:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(413224, 35770, 7151, '<td valign="top">Ooops?  Looks like they did it right.  Now a mid-air collision might fall under oops, but would be a little tasteless!  ;-)</td>', 'Ooops?  Looks like they did it right.  Now a mid-air collision might fall under oops, but would be a little tasteless!  ;-)', '2003-09-09 03:18:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(413226, 36097, 7151, '<td valign="top">Don''t get what the oops is here.</td>', 'Don''t get what the oops is here.', '2003-09-09 03:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(413228, 36085, 7151, '<td valign="top">Wild Animal Park, San Diego?</td>', 'Wild Animal Park, San Diego?', '2003-09-09 03:29:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(413230, 35738, 7151, '<td valign="top">I don''t see what''s the "oops" in this picture.  The photo''s an ok sunset, but not overly appealing.  The horizon''s a little too centered - needs to be either higher or lower - though neither the water nor the sky are overly interesting, so it''s hard to say which way it should go.</td>', 'I don''t see what''s the "oops" in this picture.  The photo''s an ok sunset, but not overly appealing.  The horizon''s a little too centered - needs to be either higher or lower - though neither the water nor the sky are overly interesting, so it''s hard to say which way it should go.', '2003-09-09 03:35:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(413231, 35458, 7151, '<td valign="top">Since neither are in the shot, and are only just barely hinted at, it doens''t work well.</td>', 'Since neither are in the shot, and are only just barely hinted at, it doens''t work well.', '2003-09-09 03:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(413232, 36053, 7151, '<td valign="top">Too shallow for what?</td>', 'Too shallow for what?', '2003-09-09 03:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(413234, 35847, 7151, '<td valign="top">Probably the best "oop" I''ve seen so far in this challenge, and a pretty well-done photo as well.</td>', 'Probably the best "oop" I''ve seen so far in this challenge, and a pretty well-done photo as well.', '2003-09-09 03:39:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(413235, 36041, 7151, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm.  Not really an "oops".  More like poor character.  I guess it''s supposed to be funny?</td>', 'Hmmmm.  Not really an "oops".  More like poor character.  I guess it''s supposed to be funny?', '2003-09-09 03:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(413236, 36146, 7151, '<td valign="top">Looks a bit too staged.  And not very well framed or lit.</td>', 'Looks a bit too staged.  And not very well framed or lit.', '2003-09-09 03:44:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(413237, 35351, 7151, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I don''t get it.</td>', 'Sorry, I don''t get it.', '2003-09-09 03:50:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(413238, 35754, 7151, '<td valign="top">Where did you get this?  I read up a little recently about printing/editing mistakes in the King James bible over the years - I don''t remember this one specifically, but it''s a pretty good idea.  I think framing and lighting could have been improved, but it''s probably a tough shot to do in an interesting way.</td>', 'Where did you get this?  I read up a little recently about printing/editing mistakes in the King James bible over the years - I don''t remember this one specifically, but it''s a pretty good idea.  I think framing and lighting could have been improved, but it''s probably a tough shot to do in an interesting way.', '2003-09-09 03:52:29.000000', NULL, 1),
