(413512, 36230, 5391, '<td valign="top">Funny!!!  This is one of the better shots I''ve seen so far.  The "Spagetti" really makes it funny.  Besides that, it''s nicely composed, exposed, and I like the selective focus on the equations, but you can still see the bottle of bourbon and there''s no doubt what it is.  Nice work.</td>', 'Funny!!!  This is one of the better shots I''ve seen so far.  The "Spagetti" really makes it funny.  Besides that, it''s nicely composed, exposed, and I like the selective focus on the equations, but you can still see the bottle of bourbon and there''s no doubt what it is.  Nice work.', '2003-09-09 13:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(413513, 36256, 5391, '<td valign="top">Great shot - having the red "2" really adds a nice focal point.  Good idea.  9</td>', 'Great shot - having the red "2" really adds a nice focal point.  Good idea.  9', '2003-09-09 13:57:46.000000', NULL, 1),
