(413644, 36073, 11943, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of this picture but personally I think it would have been improved by showing the whole of the lighter. But the white of the cigarette and the flame read very well against the darkness. I like the way you''ve used light here.</td>', 'I like the composition of this picture but personally I think it would have been improved by showing the whole of the lighter. But the white of the cigarette and the flame read very well against the darkness. I like the way you''ve used light here.', '2003-09-09 17:48:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(413646, 36051, 11943, '<td valign="top">I love black and white photographs. This one has a nice graininess to it that I like. This photo does have relevance to "oops". Very good.</td>', 'I love black and white photographs. This one has a nice graininess to it that I like. This photo does have relevance to "oops". Very good.', '2003-09-09 17:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(413648, 36256, 11943, '<td valign="top">How did you do this photo??I really like it. It''s eyecatching and snazzy. It also sums up oops very well. But ( and I''m just being really picky now) the top right hand corner is more fuzzy than the left which is a bit distacting. Sorry for using immature terms but I''m new to photography! Very good though.</td>', 'How did you do this photo??I really like it. It''s eyecatching and snazzy. It also sums up oops very well. But ( and I''m just being really picky now) the top right hand corner is more fuzzy than the left which is a bit distacting. Sorry for using immature terms but I''m new to photography! Very good though.', '2003-09-09 17:51:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(413651, 36233, 11943, '<td valign="top">This photo is very well composed and is easy to read. I particularly like the white angles of the table slicing the picture in two. It puts a different perspective on things. But, the picture alone does not really scream "oops". It''s still a good photo though and I like the imaginative view. Well done!</td>', 'This photo is very well composed and is easy to read. I particularly like the white angles of the table slicing the picture in two. It puts a different perspective on things. But, the picture alone does not really scream "oops". It''s still a good photo though and I like the imaginative view. Well done!', '2003-09-09 17:53:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(413659, 36084, 11943, '<td valign="top">I am a big fan of black and white and this is a very nice black and white picture. It is well composed and obviously well thought out but the only thing that lets it down is the title speaks for the picture. It should be the other way round I think. It should be the photo telling the story and not the title. Well done though.</td>', 'I am a big fan of black and white and this is a very nice black and white picture. It is well composed and obviously well thought out but the only thing that lets it down is the title speaks for the picture. It should be the other way round I think. It should be the photo telling the story and not the title. Well done though.', '2003-09-09 17:55:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(413663, 36186, 5391, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot, my only 10 of the challenge.  The composition is fantastic, with strong diagonals everywhere to add interest, as well as high contrast to make the photo "pop".  Nothing extraneous that shouldn''t be there (perhaps the can on the back of the toilet tank, but I assume that''s some sort of deodorizer.)  Nice work!</td>', 'Excellent shot, my only 10 of the challenge.  The composition is fantastic, with strong diagonals everywhere to add interest, as well as high contrast to make the photo "pop".  Nothing extraneous that shouldn''t be there (perhaps the can on the back of the toilet tank, but I assume that''s some sort of deodorizer.)  Nice work!', '2003-09-09 17:57:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(413666, 36041, 5391, '<td valign="top">Very creative, excellent models, good composition and exposure.  I''m not sure that the slight selenium tone adds to the composition, but it''s a minor nit-pick.  This shot really made me laugh.  Great work!  9</td>', 'Very creative, excellent models, good composition and exposure.  I''m not sure that the slight selenium tone adds to the composition, but it''s a minor nit-pick.  This shot really made me laugh.  Great work!  9', '2003-09-09 17:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(413667, 36224, 11943, '<td valign="top">I''m really sorry if I appear a bit slow but I''m not exactly sure what this picture means. I can''t see how it represents "oops". Sorry for the criticism! Anyway, it''s a lovely black and white shot (I am very partial to b&amp;w) my only improvement to it would be to focus more on the boat and not have such a large strech of water in the foreground. Before I take a picture, I try out lots of different views first through the viewfinder to see which one most clearly brings across the idea I''m trying to put forward. Hope this helps!</td>', 'I''m really sorry if I appear a bit slow but I''m not exactly sure what this picture means. I can''t see how it represents "oops". Sorry for the criticism! Anyway, it''s a lovely black and white shot (I am very partial to b&w) my only improvement to it would be to focus more on the boat and not have such a large strech of water in the foreground. Before I take a picture, I try out lots of different views first through the viewfinder to see which one most clearly brings across the idea I''m trying to put forward. Hope this helps!', '2003-09-09 17:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(413672, 35997, 11943, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice image...I love the warm orange backround and the crazy colour shoes but...sorry...I can''t see what this image has to do with "oops" . It was a very hard challenge I thought. It''s a good photo but I also judge on relevance with the challenge. Good luck with your photo taking in the future!</td>', 'This is a very nice image...I love the warm orange backround and the crazy colour shoes but...sorry...I can''t see what this image has to do with "oops" . It was a very hard challenge I thought. It''s a good photo but I also judge on relevance with the challenge. Good luck with your photo taking in the future!', '2003-09-09 18:01:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(413675, 35997, 11477, '<td valign="top">The saturation is really overblown on this, probably from Photoshop.</td>', 'The saturation is really overblown on this, probably from Photoshop.', '2003-09-09 18:02:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(413676, 35311, 11943, '<td valign="top">Yeah, this really does sum up "oops"!It''s a good idea and a good picture but I am such a perfectionist...if I had taken this photo I would have tried to get it so the whole frame was filled with the white of the table and so I wouldn''t have the blacky, brown background. If you stare at this picture for long enough, it''s almost abstract!Well done.</td>', 'Yeah, this really does sum up "oops"!It''s a good idea and a good picture but I am such a perfectionist...if I had taken this photo I would have tried to get it so the whole frame was filled with the white of the table and so I wouldn''t have the blacky, brown background. If you stare at this picture for long enough, it''s almost abstract!Well done.', '2003-09-09 18:04:35.000000', NULL, 1),
