(414321, 35791, 3084, '<td valign="top">Hi Lawrence,<br/> <br/>Thanks for explaining the technique for creating this image.  I was definitely fooled since I did not see any angle in the coffee, I had ruled out the 45 degree idea completely.  Great job and congratulations on the win.  I still hold out hope for a ribbon too, and after 32 submissions, I am thrilled to see that you finally won after 80 attempts, so there must be hope for folks like me too.<br/> <br/>Cheers,<br/>Michael</td>', 'Hi Lawrence, Thanks for explaining the technique for creating this image.  I was definitely fooled since I did not see any angle in the coffee, I had ruled out the 45 degree idea completely.  Great job and congratulations on the win.  I still hold out hope for a ribbon too, and after 32 submissions, I am thrilled to see that you finally won after 80 attempts, so there must be hope for folks like me too. Cheers,Michael', '2003-09-10 09:40:26.000000', NULL, 0),
