(414408, 35952, 11210, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for the comments, they were all nice or at least helpful (when not nice). I''m really sorry about the title, "victim" was not the word I meant. I don''t speak english that well :( I think I was thinking of "convicted" and I mixed up. The thing is that the angel there is not the one suposse to be behind bars, but a murder or a criminal instead (someone mixed them up). Got it? <br/>And about the left side, I was trying to express that she is in some kind of jail full of cells. I would have like to have a cell on the right side also, but unfortunatly there wasn''t.<br/>Well, thanks again!!! Bye</td>', 'Thank you all for the comments, they were all nice or at least helpful (when not nice). I''m really sorry about the title, "victim" was not the word I meant. I don''t speak english that well :( I think I was thinking of "convicted" and I mixed up. The thing is that the angel there is not the one suposse to be behind bars, but a murder or a criminal instead (someone mixed them up). Got it? And about the left side, I was trying to express that she is in some kind of jail full of cells. I would have like to have a cell on the right side also, but unfortunatly there wasn''t.Well, thanks again!!! Bye', '2003-09-10 11:03:41.000000', NULL, 0),
