(416106, 36028, 10108, '<td valign="top">Thanks for your comments!<br/> <br/>My thoughts about this when submitting it was the first obivous reason that something went wrong here was that it just sat there in the hand, which no bird would do without something gone wrong. Secondly something went wrong in the birds navigation, so to speak.<br/>The bird wasn´t visibly injured at first sight. The little one was just in chock. It even tried to get shelter in the hand when a big bird flew around above us.</td>', 'Thanks for your comments! My thoughts about this when submitting it was the first obivous reason that something went wrong here was that it just sat there in the hand, which no bird would do without something gone wrong. Secondly something went wrong in the birds navigation, so to speak.The bird wasn´t visibly injured at first sight. The little one was just in chock. It even tried to get shelter in the hand when a big bird flew around above us.', '2003-09-11 18:08:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(416179, 35791, 1280, '<td valign="top">Really excellent job!  For all the trouble you went through, the final image is a great success.  You make it look ez...that''s a gift...lol<br/>Congrats on a well deserved win!  Keep up the great work.<br/>Grayce</td>', 'Really excellent job!  For all the trouble you went through, the final image is a great success.  You make it look ez...that''s a gift...lolCongrats on a well deserved win!  Keep up the great work.Grayce', '2003-09-11 20:06:39.000000', NULL, 0),
