(437926, 36215, 12736, '<td valign="top">well I haven''t figured out the skewed scale here yet but I don''t think a number need be applied when its such a wonderful photograph, kinda makes ya smile and see something kind and warm inside the photographer''s heart LOL, I like the softening of it as well, I think that just accentuates the warm fuzzy feeling and smile one gets from this picture, lovely creativity here :)<br/>kindest regards,<br/>joe</td>', 'well I haven''t figured out the skewed scale here yet but I don''t think a number need be applied when its such a wonderful photograph, kinda makes ya smile and see something kind and warm inside the photographer''s heart LOL, I like the softening of it as well, I think that just accentuates the warm fuzzy feeling and smile one gets from this picture, lovely creativity here :)kindest regards,joe', '2003-10-02 05:32:49.000000', NULL, 0),
